<title>GERMANY: Veba takes over Stinnes unit.</title>
<headline>Veba takes over Stinnes unit.</headline>
<dateline>GELSENKIRCHEN, Germany 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veba Oel AG, a unit of German utility group Veba AG, said on Thursday it had acquired oil trader Stinnes Interoil AG with retroactive effect from January 1 of this year.</p>
<p>Veba Oel said it had bought Stinnes Interoil, a unit of Stinnes AG, to position itself more strongly in international oil trading and supply and develop growth markets.</p>
